WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.600
[Music]

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:23.340
[Narrator:] This is the twentieth century, modern 
man moving quickly about his business.

00:00:23.348 --> 00:00:25.848
Moving forward in a world of progress.

00:00:25.848 --> 00:00:31.414
A world so filled with today's transactions,
 man seldom finds time to look back.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:37.220
Until something extraordinary happens and he has 
no choice.

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:46.880
If this prehistoric monster appeared in the mainstream of traffic in any twentieth century city,

00:00:46.881 --> 00:00:52.481
modern man would forget today's progress, even just for long enough to get out of the way.

00:00:52.481 --> 00:00:57.647
He'd be reduced to the single basic drive every man has inherited from his ancestors:

00:00:57.648 --> 00:01:00.281
the instinct of self-preservation.

00:01:00.281 --> 00:01:04.181
The chances of meeting a dinosaur in today’s world are very slim.

00:01:04.181 --> 00:01:09.614
But the possibility of contacting another kind of 
prehistoric monster is all too real.

00:01:09.614 --> 00:01:13.147
This monster is venereal disease.

00:01:13.148 --> 00:01:18.814
This is an enlarged reproduction of the germ known as gonococcus, the germ of gonorrhea,

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:22.180
a disease known five thousand years ago to the Chinese,

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:25.680
and to the ancient Arabs, Greeks, Hindus, and Romans.

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:30.240
Still known today in the modern world of the twentieth century.

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:36.480
These are spirochete germs, shaped like corkscrews,

00:01:36.481 --> 00:01:40.947
syphilis germs, first referred to in European writings of the 15th century.

00:01:40.948 --> 00:01:46.614
Syphilis has kept pace with a changing world for 
four hundred years.

00:01:46.614 --> 00:01:51.214
Promiscuity and ignorance of the causes and consequences of the venereal diseases

00:01:51.214 --> 00:01:53.480
have contributed to their spread.

00:01:53.481 --> 00:01:57.147
There is evidence that many young people do not know that gonorrhea and syphilis

00:01:57.148 --> 00:01:59.014
are different diseases.

00:01:59.014 --> 00:02:01.780
That they can be caught only by sexual relations,

00:02:01.781 --> 00:02:04.981
and not just with an infected person of the opposite sex,

00:02:04.981 --> 00:02:09.381
but also by homosexual practices.

00:02:09.381 --> 00:02:13.081
Down through the years, much has been learned about gonorrhea and syphilis.

00:02:13.081 --> 00:02:18.181
Modern medicine has developed drugs providing our present generation with effective cures.

00:02:18.181 --> 00:02:23.447
Until today, here and now, these diseases have found a new ally, complacency.

00:02:23.448 --> 00:02:27.314
Modern society has lost its fear to the point of carelessness,

00:02:27.314 --> 00:02:31.380
and the monster venereal disease continues as a modern heritage.

00:02:31.381 --> 00:02:44.914
[Music]

00:02:44.914 --> 00:02:47.214
This young man, for instance, is a carrier.

00:02:47.214 --> 00:02:50.914
That means he is carrying in his body the germs of gonorrhea.

00:02:50.914 --> 00:02:56.314
He knows something is wrong, but still hasn't worked up the courage to talk to anyone about it.

00:02:56.314 --> 00:03:01.314
The previous weekend, John's family went to the cottage.

00:03:01.314 --> 00:03:06.347
On Saturday night, John and his buddy invited their girlfriends to the house for a few drinks.

00:03:06.348 --> 00:03:26.381
[Music]

00:03:26.381 --> 00:03:29.914
John has been going steady with Linda for six months now.

00:03:29.914 --> 00:03:33.280
He thinks more of her than any girl he has gone with before,

00:03:33.281 --> 00:03:50.647
and Linda feels the same way about John.

00:03:50.648 --> 00:03:53.648
For the last three days, John has been feeling a painful burning sensation

00:03:53.648 --> 00:03:56.448
each time he has urinated.

00:03:56.448 --> 00:03:58.981
And now this morning there was a new problem.

00:03:58.981 --> 00:04:02.814
John had seen a discharge down there and he knew it was pus.

00:04:02.814 --> 00:04:04.214
Now he was scared.

00:04:04.214 --> 00:04:05.314
What to do?

00:04:05.314 --> 00:04:06.980
There's only one thing to do.

00:04:06.981 --> 00:04:10.214
And John's friend urges him to do it, and now.

00:04:10.214 --> 00:04:13.614
See his family doctor, and as soon as possible.

00:04:13.614 --> 00:04:29.947
He's the only person who can give the right kind of advice.

00:04:29.948 --> 00:04:35.681
[Doctor:] Well John, the microscopic examination confirms that the burning sensation you've been

00:04:35.681 --> 00:04:41.081
feeling when you urinate, and also the discharge of pus that you saw this morning,

00:04:41.081 --> 00:04:44.181
are symptoms of gonorrhea,

00:04:44.181 --> 00:04:47.014
one of the venereal diseases.

00:04:47.014 --> 00:04:52.047
Now gonorrhea can have very serious consequences in an adult male as times goes on,

00:04:52.048 --> 00:04:55.148
if he does not receive the proper treatment.

00:04:55.148 --> 00:05:00.048
You see the gonorrhea germs enter a man's body at the head of the penis.

00:05:00.048 --> 00:05:05.714
They travel up and invade the lining of the urinary canal.

00:05:05.714 --> 00:05:11.514
Inflammation results, and this is what causes the burning sensation during urination.

00:05:11.514 --> 00:05:15.447
It also causes the discharges of pus from the penis.

00:05:15.448 --> 00:05:20.514
These are symptoms of gonorrhea in the acute stage when it is very infectious.

00:05:20.514 --> 00:05:26.847
And of course, anyone having such symptoms should abstain from all sexual relations.

00:05:26.848 --> 00:05:29.148
[John:] I feel all right, doctor.

00:05:29.148 --> 00:05:32.514
If I were infected, wouldn't the infection make me sick?

00:05:32.514 --> 00:05:38.380
[Doctor:] Well, if you mean nauseated or headachy when you use the word sick, the answer is no.

00:05:38.381 --> 00:05:44.114
But gonorrhea can cause complications that can completely disable a person, John.

00:05:44.114 --> 00:05:49.214
And these complications can arise if you neglect proper treatment.

00:05:49.214 --> 00:05:57.547
You see, the gonorrhea germs may extend deeper to involve the posterior part of the urinary canal,

00:05:57.548 --> 00:06:01.414
the prostate gland, and sperm canal.

00:06:01.414 --> 00:06:04.280
The infection may cause an abscess of the prostate gland

00:06:04.281 --> 00:06:07.381
and inflammation of the spermatic cord.

00:06:07.381 --> 00:06:11.214
Now this can result in sterility in a male.

00:06:11.214 --> 00:06:17.314
Arthritis also can result from a neglected gonorrhea infection.

00:06:17.314 --> 00:06:22.714
So you see John, if proper treatment isn't given as quickly as possible,

00:06:22.714 --> 00:06:28.447
the subsequent complications can become life sentences for a man.

00:06:28.448 --> 00:06:34.081
For example, he may never be a father.

00:06:34.081 --> 00:06:38.514
Now fortunately, this disease can be cured with modern drugs.

00:06:38.514 --> 00:06:46.947
But, tissues that are scarred and damaged from these complications can never be repaired.

00:06:46.948 --> 00:06:52.814
[John:] All the time we've been talking, in fact ever since I first knew something was wrong,

00:06:52.814 --> 00:06:56.914
I've been trying to figure out where I might have got this infection.

00:06:56.914 --> 00:07:00.647
I've used the toilet in public restaurants during the last two weeks.

00:07:00.648 --> 00:07:02.114
But they looked clean.

00:07:02.114 --> 00:07:03.880
Maybe the dishes weren't sterilized, or...

00:07:03.881 --> 00:07:06.614
[Doctor:] Now hold on a minute, John.

00:07:06.614 --> 00:07:13.080
You can stop all your figuring, there is only one way that you could have contracted gonorrhea.

00:07:13.081 --> 00:07:18.047
And that is through sexual intercourse with an infected person.

00:07:18.048 --> 00:07:21.314
Now, there is no immunity to the disease, John.

00:07:21.314 --> 00:07:25.014
A person can contract V.D. any number of times,

00:07:25.014 --> 00:07:29.047
and furthermore, no reliance can be placed on contraceptives

00:07:29.048 --> 00:07:31.748
as a means of preventing infection.

00:07:31.748 --> 00:07:39.214
All this business about dirty dishes and unclean washrooms I'm afraid is just a lot of nonsense.

00:07:39.214 --> 00:07:41.280
This is very important John.

00:07:41.281 --> 00:07:46.881
It means that there is an infected girl who must be found and treated before her own health

00:07:46.881 --> 00:07:52.614
can be dangerously affected, or before she passes the disease onto somebody else.

00:07:52.614 --> 00:07:58.480
Now, I would like you to tell me who the girl or girls are with whom you may have had relations

00:07:58.481 --> 00:08:00.681
during the past two weeks,

00:08:00.681 --> 00:08:03.714
and how they can be located.

00:08:03.714 --> 00:08:06.980
The health department will assist us in this.

00:08:06.981 --> 00:08:12.147
It will be done with courtesy and in the strictest confidence.

00:08:12.148 --> 00:08:14.881
The girl will not even be told who gave her name.

00:08:14.881 --> 00:08:18.147
[John:] Uh well, there was only one girl.

00:08:18.148 --> 00:08:20.714
But it couldn't have been her, doctor.

00:08:20.714 --> 00:08:23.080
We've been going steady for several months.

00:08:23.081 --> 00:08:27.314
[Doctor:] Well, you must have been infected by her, if she's the only one.

00:08:27.314 --> 00:08:30.080
She should be examined and treated immediately.

00:08:30.081 --> 00:08:35.414
Look, please try to understand how very important this is for her.

00:08:35.414 --> 00:08:38.314
Now are you being truthful when you say there were no other contacts?

00:08:38.314 --> 00:08:42.514
[John:] Yeah, she was the only one.

00:08:42.514 --> 00:08:45.580
Besides, you must be wrong.

00:08:45.581 --> 00:08:50.547
I just don't believe that she would have stayed with me knowing that I would get an infection.

00:08:50.548 --> 00:08:54.314
[Doctor:] Well, that's the sad part of this whole thing, John.

00:08:54.314 --> 00:08:58.347
This girl might be quite unaware as of yet that she is infected herself,

00:08:58.348 --> 00:09:03.248
and naturally she wouldn't know that she's passed along the infection to you.

00:09:03.248 --> 00:09:09.181
See, gonorrhea is not as easily detected in women as it is in men.

00:09:09.181 --> 00:09:12.381
It may cause fewer symptoms.

00:09:12.381 --> 00:09:15.814
But surely you can realize that you would be actually doing her a favor

00:09:15.814 --> 00:09:18.780
by seeing to it that she has the benefit of medical examination.

00:09:18.781 --> 00:09:27.614
[John:] Sure, I can see your point doctor, but I just can't believe it!

00:09:27.614 --> 00:09:34.114
[Doctor:] Whether you believe it or not isn't important John, but we must know who she is.

00:09:34.114 --> 00:09:36.280
[John:] Let me think about it for a while, doctor.

00:09:36.281 --> 00:09:40.281
I'll, I'll come back after I've had a chance to do some thinking.

00:09:40.281 --> 00:09:46.681
[Doctor:] Well, while you're taking your time John, just keep one thing in mind, will you?

00:09:46.681 --> 00:09:49.414
Time is that girl's enemy right now.

00:09:49.414 --> 00:09:52.180
And your silence could cripple her.

00:09:52.181 --> 00:09:56.481
Now I know that you think you're being honorable in withholding her name,

00:09:56.481 --> 00:10:02.681
but your mistaken sense of honor could easily lead to serious illness.

00:10:02.681 --> 00:10:08.914
Look, she has passed gonorrhea on to you, John.

00:10:08.914 --> 00:10:12.480
But if she has been promiscuous with other men, she may also be carrying

00:10:12.481 --> 00:10:16.014
the germs of syphilis in her body.

00:10:16.014 --> 00:10:22.914
Now, syphilis is even more devastating than gonorrhea if it isn't properly treated.

00:10:22.914 --> 00:10:25.480
Do you want to be an accomplice to this

00:10:25.481 --> 00:10:27.614
by keeping your secret

00:10:27.614 --> 00:10:37.514
when you're in a position to help?

00:10:37.514 --> 00:10:39.747
[John:] All right doctor.

00:10:39.748 --> 00:10:43.214
It's Linda Miller.

00:10:43.214 --> 00:10:48.280
She works as a secretary for one of the manufacturing plants in town.

00:10:48.281 --> 00:10:55.714
[Doctor:] I know you don't think so now John, but I know that you'll be glad that you've told me.

00:10:55.714 --> 00:11:08.814
[Department Of Public Health]

00:11:08.814 --> 00:11:11.047
[Linda walks into the doctor’s office.]

00:11:11.048 --> 00:11:13.314
[Miss Johnson:] So that's why we called you here.

00:11:13.314 --> 00:11:17.447
Why we think that you may have a venereal disease isn't important Linda--

00:11:17.448 --> 00:11:21.148
the important thing is that you see your doctor without delay.

00:11:21.148 --> 00:11:24.714
He'll examine you and have the laboratory test done.

00:11:24.714 --> 00:11:28.347
If you are infected, immediate treatment is terribly important.

00:11:28.348 --> 00:11:30.948
[Linda:] Wherever you're getting your information, Miss Johnson,

00:11:30.948 --> 00:11:33.748
all I can say to you is that you've got the wrong girl.

00:11:33.748 --> 00:11:36.014
Now if you'll excuse me, I'd like to be getting along.

00:11:36.014 --> 00:11:41.347
[Miss Johnson:] Linda, let me explain some of the simple facts about venereal disease to you.

00:11:41.348 --> 00:11:42.814
Hear me out.

00:11:42.814 --> 00:11:46.247
Then if you still want to leave, you're quite free to go.

00:11:46.248 --> 00:11:51.214
Gonorrhea in women or girls may cause very few symptoms.

00:11:51.214 --> 00:11:57.714
When symptoms do occur, usually they take the form of a burning sensation during urination.

00:11:57.714 --> 00:12:00.480
Or there may be a vaginal discharge.

00:12:00.481 --> 00:12:04.514
Now even when these symptoms do occur, they're often ignored.

00:12:04.514 --> 00:12:07.114
They may even disappear in a short time.

00:12:07.114 --> 00:12:10.247
But the gonorrhea germs do not disappear.

00:12:10.248 --> 00:12:13.114
They multiply and they travel.

00:12:13.114 --> 00:12:17.714
Now if early treatment is not given, the infection can spread to the uterus.

00:12:17.714 --> 00:12:20.380
And from there to the fallopian tubes.

00:12:20.381 --> 00:12:24.447
Inflammation in the fallopian tubes can cause serious illness.

00:12:24.448 --> 00:12:27.814
The scarring which results may cause sterility.

00:12:27.814 --> 00:12:31.314
Sterility, Linda.

00:12:31.314 --> 00:12:34.414
A small word with a world of meaning.

00:12:34.414 --> 00:12:36.680
You know what that can mean to a girl?

00:12:36.681 --> 00:12:39.181
No babies.

00:12:39.181 --> 00:12:42.214
Instead of the joy of a family of her own,

00:12:42.214 --> 00:12:47.514
the memory of an illness which could have been completely prevented.

00:12:47.514 --> 00:12:51.180
Now, as I said before Linda, you're perfectly free to go.

00:12:51.181 --> 00:12:53.014
But I'd like you to stay.

00:12:53.014 --> 00:12:55.647
We can discuss this problem.

00:12:55.648 --> 00:12:59.848
This is a problem Linda, a very serious one.

00:12:59.848 --> 00:13:02.614
And only you can solve it for yourself.

00:13:02.614 --> 00:13:04.047
Won't you stay?

00:13:04.048 --> 00:13:05.948
[Linda:] All right Miss Johnson, I'll stay,

00:13:05.948 --> 00:13:09.314
but I don't see how this problem applies to me.

00:13:09.314 --> 00:13:11.147
I feel all right.

00:13:11.148 --> 00:13:15.748
In fact, I have trouble keeping my weight down, I have such a good appetite.

00:13:15.748 --> 00:13:19.548
If I do have this thing, wouldn't I know it?

00:13:19.548 --> 00:13:24.314
[Ms. Johnson:] Perhaps the worst aspect of the venereal diseases is that the early signs and symptoms

00:13:24.314 --> 00:13:26.314
may be overlooked.

00:13:26.314 --> 00:13:28.980
Or passed off as some other illness.

00:13:28.981 --> 00:13:35.347
Now I've already mentioned that gonorrhea may cause few or very mild symptoms in women.

00:13:35.348 --> 00:13:40.448
It can be detected only by medical examination and laboratory test,

00:13:40.448 --> 00:13:44.981
and cured only by proper treatment from your physician.

00:13:44.981 --> 00:13:49.414
Now the first stage of syphilis in a woman may show itself by a chancre or a sore

00:13:49.414 --> 00:13:53.414
forming on the outside genital area.

00:13:53.414 --> 00:13:57.080
But often, the chancre forms internally.

00:13:57.081 --> 00:14:02.647
Now it’s typically small and painless, and because it is painless and usually hidden,

00:14:02.648 --> 00:14:07.581
syphilis often goes undetected until it's reached an advanced stage.

00:14:07.581 --> 00:14:11.881
Now, even in the later stages, syphilis may show itself by symptoms

00:14:11.881 --> 00:14:16.114
that are mistaken for other temporary, minor illnesses.

00:14:16.114 --> 00:14:21.947
Skin rash and swollen glands may appear six to eight weeks after the chancre has cleared up.

00:14:21.948 --> 00:14:24.581
A sore throat and a fever may occur.

00:14:24.581 --> 00:14:27.047
Small sores may appear around the mouth.

00:14:27.048 --> 00:14:29.648
Patches of hair may fall out.

00:14:29.648 --> 00:14:33.381
Now, any one or all of these symptoms may occur.

00:14:33.381 --> 00:14:38.647
But often their true nature isn't realized because they are so common to other illnesses.

00:14:38.648 --> 00:14:44.781
Unfortunately, often syphilis is not diagnosed until it has caused permanent damage to the heart,

00:14:44.781 --> 00:14:47.047
or nervous system.

00:14:47.048 --> 00:14:50.214
[Linda:] But if the infection is noticed soon enough, isn't there some kind of medicine

00:14:50.214 --> 00:14:55.514
that a person could buy at a drug store to clear it up?

00:14:55.514 --> 00:15:00.647
[Miss Johnson:] Linda, there isn't any kind of medicine that can be bottled or [?]

00:15:00.648 --> 00:15:03.048
to cure a venereal disease.

00:15:03.048 --> 00:15:06.914
One must rely on proper drugs prescribed by a doctor.

00:15:06.914 --> 00:15:11.880
Now any person who's foolish enough to believe that a bottle of pills or a tube of ointment

00:15:11.881 --> 00:15:17.547
in a plain wrapper might be effective in the treatment or cure of venereal disease

00:15:17.548 --> 00:15:20.581
is going to very sorry later in life.

00:15:20.581 --> 00:15:23.447
[Linda:] I don't remember that chancre you described.

00:15:23.448 --> 00:15:26.714
And I'd certainly remember that burning feeling if I ever had it.

00:15:26.714 --> 00:15:29.480
In fact, I don't seem to have any of the symptoms at all.

00:15:29.481 --> 00:15:31.947
So how can you be so sure I have an infection?

00:15:31.948 --> 00:15:34.614
[Miss Johnson:] I'm not sure, Linda!

00:15:34.614 --> 00:15:37.947
In fact I, I sincerely hope you're right.

00:15:37.948 --> 00:15:44.114
But the only way we can know, either of us for sure, is for you to be examined by your own doctor.

00:15:44.114 --> 00:15:49.014
Look, think about it this way for a moment,

00:15:49.014 --> 00:15:52.980
in a few years’ time you are very likely to be getting married.

00:15:52.981 --> 00:15:56.547
But if a woman with untreated syphilis becomes pregnant,

00:15:56.548 --> 00:16:00.614
she could pass this disease onto her unborn child.

00:16:00.614 --> 00:16:07.014
Now, that means that it’s possible that the baby could be born dead or deformed.

00:16:07.014 --> 00:16:11.247
Now before your wedding, your doctor will advise a blood test.

00:16:11.248 --> 00:16:17.481
If you are infected, wouldn't you rather find out about it now?

00:16:17.481 --> 00:16:19.447
Get the proper treatment and be cured?

00:16:19.448 --> 00:16:22.814
Instead of waiting two or three days before your wedding date?

00:16:22.814 --> 00:16:26.547
Venereal disease does not go away by ignoring it, Linda.

00:16:26.548 --> 00:16:32.714
Please, don't wait any longer.

00:16:32.714 --> 00:16:36.214
And Linda, if you are infected, the doctor will ask you for the name of the person

00:16:36.214 --> 00:16:38.614
who gave you the disease.

00:16:38.614 --> 00:16:40.380
Now please cooperate so that the proper steps...

00:16:40.381 --> 00:16:42.447
[Linda:] Proper steps?

00:16:42.448 --> 00:16:44.181
What does that mean?

00:16:44.181 --> 00:16:49.581
And anyway, how would I know how I got the disease even if I was infected, or where?

00:16:49.581 --> 00:16:51.981
These germs must be everywhere.

00:16:51.981 --> 00:16:55.414
I could have picked it up from a toilet seat some place.

00:16:55.414 --> 00:16:59.847
[Miss Johnson:] Linda, it just doesn't happen that way.

00:16:59.848 --> 00:17:06.581
Venereal disease is transmitted from one adult to another through intimate sexual contact.

00:17:06.581 --> 00:17:13.014
Now look, and I'm not stressing this because I want to pry into your private life,

00:17:13.014 --> 00:17:17.447
but if you are infected, I'm asking you to tell the doctor in private the name of the person

00:17:17.448 --> 00:17:19.914
who passed venereal disease to you.

00:17:19.914 --> 00:17:23.914
He may have infected others and they'll infect still others.

00:17:23.914 --> 00:17:29.214
It's your serious responsibility to protect the health of other people as well as your own.

00:17:29.214 --> 00:17:33.680
Now you can do this by giving the doctor the information he asks for

00:17:33.681 --> 00:17:37.447
so that all contacts can be located, and like you,

00:17:37.448 --> 00:17:41.248
be given the benefit of an examination and treatment if necessary.

00:17:41.248 --> 00:17:44.081
[Linda:] And what happens after I tell the doctor who it is?

00:17:44.081 --> 00:17:47.547
[Miss Johnson:] The doctor may contact him, or he may obtain the help

00:17:47.548 --> 00:17:51.081
of trained health department people to follow up the case.

00:17:51.081 --> 00:17:56.981
Either way, tact and discretion are used to avoid any embarrassment.

00:17:56.981 --> 00:17:59.947
[Linda:] I don't see how that can be done in my case.

00:17:59.948 --> 00:18:07.614
Last month I had my first experience, with a man quite a lot older than I am.

00:18:07.614 --> 00:18:10.247
It only happened once.

00:18:10.248 --> 00:18:13.414
I didn't know it could lead to this.

00:18:13.414 --> 00:18:17.680
He was staying at the summer resort where I was spending my holidays.

00:18:17.681 --> 00:18:21.081
I know his name but I don't know where he lives.

00:18:21.081 --> 00:18:24.281
I don't think he comes from this part of the country at all.

00:18:24.281 --> 00:18:28.514
[Miss Johnson:] All you can do is give his name and the name of the summer resort to the doctor.

00:18:28.514 --> 00:18:30.514
He'll take it from there.

00:18:30.514 --> 00:18:38.314
Now, let's make an appointment with your family doctor.

00:18:38.314 --> 00:18:42.080
[Nurse:] Dr. Ferguson, this is Linda Miller.

00:18:42.081 --> 00:18:46.481
[Dr. Ferguson:] Hello Linda, come in.

00:18:46.481 --> 00:18:49.614
Won't you sit down?

00:18:49.614 --> 00:18:56.180
[She looks at the nurse who gives her the nod of approval.]

00:18:56.181 --> 00:18:59.814
[Linda:] Hello doctor. Miss Johnson, the public health nurse, told me it’s possible

00:18:59.814 --> 00:19:02.647
that I might have an infection.

00:19:02.648 --> 00:19:05.981
That's what I came to see you about.

00:19:05.981 --> 00:19:11.681
[Narrator:] These two young people, by a chain of circumstances, contracted venereal disease.

00:19:11.681 --> 00:19:16.581
But fortunately their infection was detected early enough and treatment begun in time to cure it

00:19:16.581 --> 00:19:19.447
before serious consequences could result.

00:19:19.448 --> 00:19:22.048
But what of the man quite a lot older than Linda?

00:19:22.048 --> 00:19:23.748
Will he be so fortunate?

00:19:23.748 --> 00:19:29.814
Linda's doctor and public health personnel will do everything possible to find him and treat him.

00:19:29.814 --> 00:19:34.947
But how many others will become infected before the chain of infection is broken?

00:19:34.948 --> 00:19:38.548
[Dr. Ferguson:] Venereal diseases are no respecters of persons.

00:19:38.548 --> 00:19:41.948
The health of thousands of our people is threatened by the increase

00:19:41.948 --> 00:19:45.148
in the incidence of venereal diseases.

00:19:45.148 --> 00:19:49.014
The medical profession and public health departments,

00:19:49.014 --> 00:19:54.647
are concerned by the widespread occurrence of infectious syphilis and gonorrhea.

00:19:54.648 --> 00:19:58.414
Public clinics provide free treatment in most communities.

00:19:58.414 --> 00:20:02.247
But they can't help without your cooperation.

00:20:02.248 --> 00:20:05.948
Venereal disease can affect people of any age.

00:20:05.948 --> 00:20:13.481
Not even the unborn baby is safe from the body-destroying menace of venereal disease.

00:20:13.481 --> 00:20:20.214
Ignorance, apathy, relaxation of moral standards are its allies.

00:20:20.214 --> 00:20:24.880
Linda discovered this the difficult way, by experience.

00:20:24.881 --> 00:20:31.881
Education and a constant awareness of the danger of promiscuous sexual behavior

00:20:31.881 --> 00:20:37.181
must become a part of our daily life.

00:20:37.181 --> 00:20:41.581
[Narrator:] This is the twentieth century, but how many of us in our modern age are still

00:20:41.581 --> 00:20:47.247
in a prehistoric stage in our thinking about
 venereal disease.

00:20:47.248 --> 00:20:51.614
Why has venereal disease continued as a blight on society down through the ages,

00:20:51.614 --> 00:20:58.980
when it should be as extinct as this dinosaur in this day of scientific marvel?

00:20:58.981 --> 00:21:02.481
How long will it take society to develop a social conscious as advanced

00:21:02.481 --> 00:21:06.181
as the material gains we now enjoy?

00:21:06.181 --> 00:21:12.714
Can syphilis and gonorrhea be eradicated before we defeat complacency and ignorance?

00:21:12.714 --> 00:21:16.614
Can our generation govern its own behavior sufficiently to abolish the menace

00:21:16.614 --> 00:21:21.180
of venereal disease for future generations?

00:21:21.180 --> 00:21:51.340
[Music]

